{"repositoryId":1326204369,"availability":"available","full":"bamr87/irony-works","name":"irony-works","description":"The perpetual encyclopedia of irony: a self-growing, AI-tended Obsidian vault published with zer0-mistakes.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-07T04:25:59Z","updated":"2026-10-17T19:48:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bamr87.github.io/irony-works/","topics":["ai","claude-code","github-pages","jekyll","knowledge-base","obsidian","zer0-mistakes"],"demo":"https://bamr87.github.io/irony-works/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.362Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.362Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.362Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.362Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The perpetual encyclopedia of irony. Expectation, reversed. Recursively.","Irony Works is a self-growing Obsidian vault that catalogs irony in all its forms — past, present, and pending — and, since its second genus was planted, paradoxes old, new, debated, and hypothetical; tended by an AI engine and published to the web with the zer0-mistakes theme. It is a seed, not a site: clone it, plant it, and the germination cycle takes over.","An encyclopedia of irony compiled by a machine that cannot be embarrassed is either the death of the form or its final proof. This repository exists to find out."],"features":["Entries must state an expectation and a reversal in front matter, so irony can be checked","The Alanis Gate scores candidate entries before they leave the nursery","A second genus for paradoxes, old, new, debated and hypothetical","An AI germination cycle (scout, gate, scribe, nursery and compost) run from engine/scripts/","The vault is transplanted into a Jekyll collection and published with the zer0-mistakes theme"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bamr87/irony-works/blob/main/RE